# --- Run outputs -------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw inspect_ai eval logs: ~270 MB, too large for git. They are archived as a
# zip outside the repo and checksummed in data/raw-manifest.json (committed),
# which is the reproducibility record. See NOTES.md 2026-09-11.
data/raw/
# Safety net: a stray .eval anywhere (e.g. DarkBench/logs/ when eval-retry
# ignores --log-dir) is a multi-MB file that should never be committed.
*.eval
logs/
# Archives (the raw-log zip lives on the Desktop, but guard against a copy here)
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Hand labels ARE tracked on purpose — data/labels/ is Eileen's ground truth and
# is small. Do not add it here.

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.python-version

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# API keys live in ~/.zshrc, never in the repo. These are belt-and-braces.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
credentials.*

# --- Editors / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.AppleDouble
Icon?
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- Submission narrative ---------------------------------------------------
# The blog post / submission text is not versioned here: it lives on the BlueDot
# Notion submission page. docs/BLOG.md is kept locally as the drafting copy so the
# figures and links stay reproducible, but it is deliberately not committed.
docs/BLOG.md
